        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0760fu9Ff4Lb-68CpvtQV3n79S8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16091-baby-back-ribs-VAT-001-Step-1-1defa340eb994bd08f124717309410de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16091/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut ribs into 4 equal portions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YoWedFFa0cMSsIouWc4-0dzxGMY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16091-baby-back-ribs-VAT-002-Step-2-9d5066379cdd4d35a7b96b2fb2379a8f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16091/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tear off 4 pieces of aluminum foil big enough to enclose each portion of ribs. Grease each piece of foil with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QNlCIhjCi-L7rG0WBi-2IuAOMl4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16091-baby-back-ribs-VAT-003-Step-3-6ee45ede78124702b7fb73df973d7b86.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16091/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush ribs liberally with barbecue sauce; place each portion of ribs on a piece of foil. Wrap tightly and refrigerate for 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oFIx1tdvcYDRjOG0huteD_2jgqY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16091-baby-back-ribs-VAT-004-Step-4-9d829393e003454390b915a1bcb3a4cc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16091/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C). Bake ribs wrapped tightly in foil in the preheated oven for 2 ½ hours. Remove ribs from foil and serve with more sauce, if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p7AWZFUp0_gcyY04Ud_nTosMt_c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16091-baby-back-ribs-VAT-005-Step-5-A-3664d9e2b6984b2c9d7f9a434ec2c877.jpg"
